(footprint "Winbond_USON8_4x3mm_UU"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "8-pad USON 4x3 mm, 0.80 mm pitch: Winbond W25Q64JW Rev.E (10 Mar 2021) section 10.4 p69, package code UU (D 4.00, E 3.00, b 0.30, e 0.80, L 0.60, two centre metal bars D1/D2 0.80 x E1 0.20). Macronix MX25U3232F Rev.1.2 (15 Nov 2022) section 20-2 p91, package ZB, has the same dimensions and pad order, so this land serves both. Land 0.35 x 0.80 mm (0.05 mm past the pad heel, 0.15 mm past the body edge) is a Claude choice, not a manufacturer land pattern; neither datasheet gives one. The two centre bars get NO land and stay floating (both datasheets allow floating or GND); keep bottom-layer tracks and vias out from under them. Courtyard: 0.10 mm past the body ends and the pad toes.")
